extends ../layout.pug

block content
  p 
    | Hi #{(user && user.name) || 'there'},
  p 
    | #{(invitedBy && invitedBy.name) || 'Someone'} has invited you to help manage 
    strong #{(artist && artist.name) || 'an artist'} 
    | on Mirlo.
  p 
    | Once you accept, you'll be able to edit the artist's page, releases, merch and posts, and see their sales.
  p 
    a(href!=`${client}/manage`) Review the invite
  p 
    | If you weren't expecting this, you can ignore this email.
